      ],
      "source": "https://www.sussexcountyclerk.org/558/Snufftown---Stockholm",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The Stockholm School, built in 1882, later became the town’s municipal building and remains a local landmark.",
